./run_log/one_bar_dukascopy_2013_2026_20261011_mission.md:7:Data: /home/quant/dev/quant/ml4t-data/.data/store/index_minute_NQ/year=*/month=*/data.parquet is Dukascopy source usatechidxusd; 163 monthly files, 3,883,929 rows, from 2013-01-01 to 2026-07-14, with naive timestamp. Verify UTC timestamp interpretation against existing ingestion source and calendar qualifications. This is a Nasdaq index/CFD price proxy, NOT verified CME E-mini NQ futures. The previous study mistakenly used only 2026 LSE proxy and cannot address the manager's ~4800 trade graph. Do not change/store canonical source; do not read protected Aug2026 onward.
