scripts/supplement_tokyo_fix_program3_ohlcv_execution_20261011_v1.py:38:    lines=[f'# Tokyo Fix Program3: OHLCV execution audit', '', '**Decision: RESEARCH COMPLETE / EXPLORATORY / NOT_APPROVED.**', '', 'The post-fix Gotobi short does not remain robustly positive under the frozen conservative limit-fill bounds. At the assumed 1-pip roundtrip cost, the native market benchmark earns $212.27 on 468 signals. Eleven of twelve native limit bounds lose money. The +1-pip offset, 3-minute TTL, zero-buffer bound earns $18.99, or $0.041 per submitted signal. Its 0.5-pip-buffer version loses $64.59. Every limit bound loses money in Jan–Aug2026. This rejects the stated robustness criterion. No winner was selected.', '', '## Evidence scope and source seal', '', '**VERIFIED:** Seven immutable annual LSE USDJPY minute OHLCV snapshots and the inherited Tokyo bank calendar supply 2020 through August2026. UTC timestamps denote minute opens and are converted to Asia/Tokyo. No data at or after2026-09-01 JST were read. All sources have SHA256 identities in `source_manifest.json`. Earlier Program1/2 artifacts and unrelated dirty files remain preserved.', '', '**INFERENCE:** A minute close becomes available one minute after its open timestamp. The simulation uses09:54 close as the reference available at09:55. It never uses09:55 close to submit the order. The first permitted fill is09:56.', '', '**UNKNOWN:** Prices are vendor composites. Volume is not verified executed FX volume. The local inventory has no USDJPY tick, paired bid/ask or depth data. Legacy8,507 BID candle files are not executable quotes. Broker contract, commissions, spread, lot constraints, queue position, latency, actual passive-fill probability, capacity and dealer inventory remain unknown. The notional is fixed USD10,000, with USD10,000 initial equity and no compounding. This is a research price proxy for an unspecified retail FX contract.', '', 'All studied years were already observed. 2020–23 is development, 2024–25 is retrospective validation, and Jan–Aug2026 is observed regime stress. September–October2026 remains sealed. No period is relabeled unseen OOS.', '', '## Completeness and execution contract', '', f'**VERIFIED:** The09:54–10:30 contiguous minute gate retains {complete["cohort_n"]} bank dates: {complete["gotobi_n"]} Gotobi and {complete["ordinary_n"]} ordinary. The gate requires each timestamp and valid finite OHLC geometry. `window_gates.parquet` and `T0_quality/result.json` retain missingness by year, weekday and Gotobi. Proxy and placebo windows use their own completeness gates. No fill is forward-filled. Five-minute staleness and zero volume are reported; unchanged composite closes alone do not establish an unavailable quote.', '', 'Native `ml4t.backtest.Engine`0.1.7 matches LIMIT orders on inclusive touches. Native fixed slippage can violate the sell limit price. The supported `PositiveVolumeLimit` execution gate therefore receives synthetic0/1 eligibility volume; raw OHLC remains unchanged. The gate permits a sell fill only when high strictly exceeds limit plus buffer within the frozen TTL. This gate is a hypothetical execution bound, not signal information or measured fill probability. The native engine owns fills, positions, cancellation and account cash. No second backtest loop exists.', '', 'The sell limit equals09:54 close plus0/0.5/1pip. Native price is the exact limit; favorable gap improvement is not assumed. TTL1 allows09:56; TTL3 allows09:56–09:58. Cancellation occurs after the last permitted matching cycle. Filled shorts close through a native MARKET submission at10:09 and fill at10:10 open. Missed signals have no invented trade and no closing order. There is no overnight or post-exit exposure.', '', 'The native ledger is JPY. Each closed JPY profit is divided by its actual raw exit USDJPY price. Assumed all-in costs0.8/1.0/1.4/2.0pips are separate quote-currency cash-flow overlays, not changes to native limit prices. Market and passive scenarios have separate illustrative entry/exit budgets but equal total costs. There is no maker rebate or zero-spread assumption. Actual costs are unverified.', '', '## Native results at1-pip roundtrip cost', '', '| Arm | Signals | Touches | Fills | Missed/cancelled | Net USD | USD/signal | USD/fill | Win rate | PF | Daily Sharpe | Close DD% | Minute-close MTM DD% |', '|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
