run_log/one_bar_dukascopy_2013_2026_20261011/agent.log:71:EXACT user rules: 30-minute bars on extended market session; long buy stop at previous 50 COMPLETE 30m bars highest high; short sell stop at previous 50 COMPLETE 30m bars lowest low; OCO after first trigger; exit market at opening print of the immediately following 30m bar; $1000 per trade protective stop; max two filled entries per Chicago Globex session day. One illustrative NQ-equivalent contract ($20/point, $1000=50 points). NO optimizations, new filters, volatility filters, or parameter changes. 1m source for triggering and protective stop path, strict lookahead safety, exclude incomplete 30m bars and missing expected opening-print bars rather than pretending continuous data. Describe non-CME tick/grid issues and deterministic proxy mapping. Use native ml4t.backtest.Strategy/Engine/DataFeed, no handrolled simulator or metric loops. Compare zero-cost and cost-aware with previous price assumption $2.50 per side plus one quarter NQ tick adverse slippage per side. Account initial $1,000,000 purely for metrics.
