run_log/fx_support_ml4t_execution_20261008_v2/codex_objective.md:24:4. Implement real installed ml4t.backtest.Strategy plus Engine and run E0 unfiltered 730 events (2017-24), E1 112 OOF ML-selected with same execution, E2 selected at cost stress 2.5bp roundtrip, E3 selected flat before Prague midnight. Long only. Signal after retest close; entry next 5m open. Native bracket STOP at origin support first, LIMIT target at previous high+1e-5 second with shared parent OCO. Gap-aware stop and stop-first ties; no free same-bar fills. Risk .5 percent current equity per entry, 1 percent concurrent, one position per pair, quantity down to 1000 base units, max gross 3x equity, initial USD100k. Time expiry 240 complete 30m market bars; close terminal positions. Explicit cash/margin. Commission .25bps per side fraction .000025, slippage .50bps fraction .00005; stress slippage fraction .0001. Inspect native fees, prices, order statuses. Never simulate custom PnL loops.
